Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.62,0:01:06.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶  捉水母
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:06.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, jellyfishing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.87,0:01:08.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我等不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.87,0:01:08.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't wait
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.09,0:01:09.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你呢  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.09,0:01:09.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you, Patrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:12.92,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,766)}塔塔酱
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.30,0:01:10.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.30,0:01:10.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.82,0:01:12.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚有说话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:12.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.90,0:01:14.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.90,0:01:14.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said--
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.89,0:01:17.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不太清楚那句话要怎么回
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.89,0:01:17.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to respond to that
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.25,0:01:19.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.25,0:01:19.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.45,0:01:25.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们被困在这了  忘了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.45,0:01:25.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're stuck here, remember?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.15,0:01:26.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.15,0:01:26.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.32,0:01:29.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为你忘记在出发前给无影船加油了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.32,0:01:27.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because you forgot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.48,0:01:29.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to fill up the boatmobile before we left
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.63,0:01:30.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看见没
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.63,0:01:30.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.94,0:01:31.15,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1154,188)}燃料
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.15,0:01:33.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大英雄们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.15,0:01:33.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, heroes
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.23,0:01:34.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们可以帮什么忙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.23,0:01:34.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is there anything we can do?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.01,0:01:48.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好重一团空气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.01,0:01:48.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is a heavy piece of nothin'
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.95,0:01:52.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以说就这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.95,0:01:52.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So is that it?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.17,0:01:53.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就这样  谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.17,0:01:53.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you, boys
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.75,0:01:55.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们平常不会这样  但为了回报
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.75,0:01:55.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We usually don't do this, but in return
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.77,0:01:58.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们帮忙把无影船推过了那么多座山
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.77,0:01:58.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for pushing the invisiboat up all those hills
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.97,0:02:00.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要给你们看点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.97,0:02:00.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,there's something I'd like you to see
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.80,0:02:04.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但你们必须保证什么都别碰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.80,0:02:04.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But you must promise not to touch anything
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.21,0:02:06.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.21,0:02:06.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.00,0:02:16.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是第1582集的魔法蟹爪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:16.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The magic claw from episode 1582
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.72,0:02:18.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,射线恶魔的强力手套
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:18.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Man Ray's power glove
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.61,0:02:20.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一副双筒望远镜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.61,0:02:20.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A pair of binoculars
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.28,0:02:23.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  这是我们的回忆柜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.28,0:02:23.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, boys, this is our locker of memories
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.72,0:02:25.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,里面装着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.72,0:02:25.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It contains
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.65,0:02:28.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.65,0:02:28.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't remember
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.75,0:02:32.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,里面装着我们非凡冒险的纪念品
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:30.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It contains all the memorabilia
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.62,0:02:32.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from our superhuman adventures
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.28,0:02:34.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  快来看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.28,0:02:34.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob, check it out
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.84,0:02:36.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肮脏泡泡的泡泡棒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:36.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The dirty bubble's bubble wand
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.38,0:02:37.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:37.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Correct
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.35,0:02:48.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们怕不怕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:48.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Scared, boys?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.18,0:02:49.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.18,0:02:49.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.47,0:02:50.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用怕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.47,0:02:50.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, don't be
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.69,0:02:54.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要不乱碰东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:54.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And as long as no one touches anything
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.09,0:02:56.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里就没什么好怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.09,0:02:56.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,there's nothing here to be scared of
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.03,0:02:57.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:57.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Understood
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.09,0:02:59.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是我们的时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:02:59.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And this is our time machine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.65,0:03:06.04,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(952,220)}时空旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.65,0:03:06.04,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(780,578)}日期
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.65,0:03:06.04,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1246,648)}裤头村\N地点
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.65,0:03:03.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以把我们传送到未来或者过去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.65,0:03:00.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This device allows us
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.99,0:03:03.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to transport into the future or past
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.72,0:03:06.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,日期和目的地可以任意挑选
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:06.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,at a date or destination of our choosing
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.54,0:03:08.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不幸的是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:08.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.27,0:03:11.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,倘若改变历史进程  后果将十分危险
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.27,0:03:10.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the consequences of altering the order of history
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.66,0:03:11.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,are so dangerous
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.79,0:03:13.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因此我们选择不去碰它
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.79,0:03:13.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we've chosen to leave it alone
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.40,0:03:15.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以你们不准碰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:15.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So you mustn't touch
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.14,0:03:18.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这零食贩卖机吞了我两毛五
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.14,0:03:18.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This snack machine took my quarter
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.01,0:03:19.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要我的香脆油渣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.01,0:03:19.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want my crunchity munchities
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.07,0:03:21.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.07,0:03:21.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.56,0:03:22.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,破箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:22.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stupid box
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:23.34,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(936,710)}启动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.51,0:03:25.05,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(712,896)}日期              地点
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.93,0:03:28.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们真得把那玩意给修好才行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:28.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You really got to get that thing fixed
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.89,0:03:30.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.89,0:03:30.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You fool
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.18,0:03:31.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知不知道你闯了什么祸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.18,0:03:31.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you realize what you've done?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.65,0:03:33.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我两毛五硬币没了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.65,0:03:33.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I lost a quarter
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.88,0:04:05.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.88,0:04:05.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.10,0:04:08.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:08.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It can't be
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:10.77,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1028,610)}裤头村\N人口数 {\fnArial}38
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.14,0:04:10.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村至少有39名居民
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:10.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bikini Bottom has at least 39 people living here
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.77,0:04:12.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许在你们印象中是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.77,0:04:12.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe as you knew it
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.28,0:04:15.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但这里可是另一个时空里的裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.28,0:04:15.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but this is a different Bikini Bottom of another time
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.27,0:04:19.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是你乖乖听话不碰时光机  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.27,0:04:17.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe if you hadn't touched the time machine
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.73,0:04:19.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,like we told you, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.42,0:04:21.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们就不会碰上这岔子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:21.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't be in this mess
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.11,0:04:24.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但愿我们出现在这里没改变什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.11,0:04:23.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hopefully we haven't changed anything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.03,0:04:24.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with our presence
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.62,0:04:26.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一切看着都好复古啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:26.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everything looks so old-fashioned
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:30.91,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1124,374)}杂货铺
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.81,0:04:53.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我准备好统治世界  掠取财富了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:53.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to rule the world and its riches
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.28,0:04:56.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这把武器在手  我天下无敌
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.28,0:04:56.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With this weapon, nothing can stop me
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.22,0:04:57.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你做梦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.22,0:04:57.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's what you think
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.78,0:05:00.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:05:00.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.32,0:05:01.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  射线恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:01.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Man Ray
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.60,0:05:04.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我忠实的搭档企鹅男孩  还有我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:04.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but my stalwart companion, Barnacle Boy, and I
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.95,0:05:06.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不敢苟同
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.95,0:05:06.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,beg to differ with you
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.65,0:05:10.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你对抗正义就大错特错了  射线恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.65,0:05:08.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've tangled with the wrong end
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:10.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of the fish hook of justice, Man Ray
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.17,0:05:12.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好迎接一大份的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.17,0:05:12.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now prepare for a heaping helping
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.35,0:05:15.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,速干塔塔酱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.35,0:05:15.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of quick-drying tartar sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:14.75,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(654,442)}塔塔酱
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.70,0:05:18.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们当年的身体好紧实啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:18.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Our bodies were so tight
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.92,0:05:19.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哪里出岔子了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:19.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What went wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.02,0:05:24.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的水母啊  美人鱼战士
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:24.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jumpin' jellyfish, Mermaid Man
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.87,0:05:26.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,塔塔酱怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.87,0:05:26.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened to the tartar sauce?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.82,0:05:31.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还好这附近有那玩意能吃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:31.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good thing that was around
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.57,0:05:32.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都快饿死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.57,0:05:32.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was starving
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.64,0:05:33.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:33.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Curious
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.20,0:05:35.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会不会是我忘了补塔塔酱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:35.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Could I have forgotten to refill it?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.72,0:05:40.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,简直要吓死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.72,0:05:40.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is creeping me out
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.88,0:05:42.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩咋办
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:42.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, what about Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.93,0:05:44.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没空管那个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:44.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't got time for that
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.88,0:05:46.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们跑去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.88,0:05:46.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, boys?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.30,0:05:49.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只想回家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:49.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just want to go home
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.11,0:05:49.95,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(260,678)}返回
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.67,0:05:53.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以后什么时候要把那两个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.67,0:05:53.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When are we gonna have those two
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.32,0:05:54.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,重新归类为反派
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:54.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,reclassified as villains?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.05,0:05:58.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们丢下我们不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.05,0:05:58.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They left us here
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.32,0:05:59.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:05:59.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.48,0:06:02.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,船到桥头自然直
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:02.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll all work out
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.38,0:06:05.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用担心  美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:05.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.25,0:06:07.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,永远都会出手帮助老人家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.25,0:06:07.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,are always here to help the elderly
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.66,0:06:11.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这两位感觉有点眼熟  企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:09.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's something familiar
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:11.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,about these two, Barnacle Boy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.10,0:06:13.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但就是指不出哪里熟了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:13.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just can't put my flipper on it
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.05,0:06:15.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,帽子不错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.05,0:06:15.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Neat hat
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.21,0:06:17.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.21,0:06:17.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.81,0:06:23.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来带这两位手无寸铁的可怜老人家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:23.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's get these poor, defenseless seniors
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.33,0:06:24.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,远离危险
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:24.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,out of harm's way
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.61,0:06:38.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这还差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.61,0:06:38.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's more like it--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.12,0:06:41.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回到了熟悉的现代裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.12,0:06:41.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,back in good ole present-day Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.21,0:06:43.54,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(704,120)}射线恶魔大都会
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.54,0:06:44.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:44.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.64,0:06:47.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们都出生在属于自己的时空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.64,0:06:47.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're all born in our own place and time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:51.55,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1032,204)}我知道\N你在做什么
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.57,0:06:48.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  市民朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:48.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, fellow citizen
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.55,0:06:53.26,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1066,394)}他有计谋
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.57,0:06:55.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  章鱼威廉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.57,0:06:55.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, Squilliam
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.93,0:06:57.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,射线恶魔万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:57.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Man Ray is great
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.62,0:06:58.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.62,0:06:58.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.08,0:07:01.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他一定是犯了法  被罚做社区服务了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:06:59.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Must be taking care
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:01.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of his community service obligations
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.60,0:07:03.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就是他横穿马路的教训
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:03.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That'll teach him to jaywalk
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:08.53,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(732,190)}我在看着你
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.84,0:07:10.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,话说  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.84,0:07:10.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say, uh, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.21,0:07:13.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你注意到我们美丽的城市哪不一样没
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.21,0:07:13.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,do you notice anything different about our fair city?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.52,0:07:15.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  我听不见
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.52,0:07:15.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I couldn't hear you
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.07,0:07:17.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,镣铐声音太吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.07,0:07:17.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,over the clatter of prison chains
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.67,0:07:22.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说咱回来后裤头村有没有哪怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.67,0:07:20.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said isn't there something odd
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:22.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,about Bikini Bottom since we got back?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.65,0:07:23.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.65,0:07:23.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.90,0:07:24.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还真有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:24.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But yes
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.21,0:07:27.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看那块可怕的巨大广告牌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:27.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just look at that giant menacing billboard
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:28.88,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(278,396)}他有把射线枪\N而且还敢开枪
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.94,0:07:31.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,右下角少了一颗螺栓
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:31.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's missing a bolt on the bottom right corner
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.68,0:07:33.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有更严重的  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:33.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Even worse than that, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.74,0:07:35.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,警察换了新制服
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:35.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The police got new uniforms
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.93,0:07:37.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:37.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.22,0:07:39.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们把旧制服怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.22,0:07:39.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What did they do with those old ones?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.68,0:07:41.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:41.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And yikes
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.09,0:07:42.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.09,0:07:42.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened to the krusty krab?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.07,0:07:47.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,本指定区域可令你们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.07,0:07:47.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"The designated area where you are permitted
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.65,0:07:49.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,经射线恶魔  你们的统治者允许
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.65,0:07:49.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"by Man Ray, your ruler
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.50,0:07:52.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,使用射线恶魔元购买三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:52.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to obtain sandwiches using Man Ray dollars"?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.62,0:07:56.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看出来这里面暗藏的惨剧了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:56.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you see the underlying tragedy in all this?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.02,0:07:58.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没射线恶魔元吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.02,0:07:58.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm all out of Man Ray dollars?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.44,0:07:59.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.44,0:07:59.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.27,0:08:02.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,意思就是我们回到过去的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:02.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It means that we somehow changed the course of history
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.33,0:08:03.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不小心改变了历史进程
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:03.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when we went into the past
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.79,0:08:07.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在这个时空里  射线恶魔是统治者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.79,0:08:07.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and now, in this reality, Man Ray is ruler
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.52,0:08:08.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们得想想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.52,0:08:08.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We got to do something
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.68,0:08:09.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么办法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.68,0:08:09.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But what?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.23,0:08:11.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自由世界里任何有自尊的居民
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.23,0:08:11.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What any self-respecting citizen of the free world
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.75,0:08:13.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在紧急情况下都会做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:13.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,would do in a time of crisis
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.35,0:08:14.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看我工作还在不在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:14.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See if I still have a job
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.87,0:08:18.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你吃得不够快
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.87,0:08:18.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not eating fast enough
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.45,0:08:21.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思  章鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:21.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, squid--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.93,0:08:21.14,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1162,542)}射线恶魔\N造型
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.01,0:08:22.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.01,0:08:22.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.64,0:08:24.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:24.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Barnacle Boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.80,0:08:25.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在这干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:25.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.82,0:08:28.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是在反思我虚度的一生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:28.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just taking stock of a wasted life
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.61,0:08:29.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.61,0:08:29.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order up
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.11,0:08:30.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美人鱼战士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:30.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mermaid Man
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.37,0:08:31.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且还戴着顶发网
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.37,0:08:31.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And he's wearing a hairnet
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.87,0:08:34.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.87,0:08:34.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.00,0:08:36.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么两位最伟大的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:36.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why are the two greatest heroes ever
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.10,0:08:37.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会困在这家小餐馆里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:37.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,stuck in this greasy spoon
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.82,0:08:39.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不去对抗射线恶魔的恶行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:39.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not combating the evils of Man Ray?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.83,0:08:44.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很早就失去了战斗的渴望与体格
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:44.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I lost the desire and the physique to fight long ago, kid
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.70,0:08:48.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,翻肉饼对关节造成的负担可少多了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.70,0:08:48.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Flipping patties is so much easier on the joints
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.44,0:08:49.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等你到我这年纪就懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:49.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when you're my age
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.80,0:08:52.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那年轻版的美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:52.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What about the younger Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.35,0:08:54.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们可绝不会不打一场就投降
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.35,0:08:54.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Surely they refused to surrender without a fight
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.72,0:08:56.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你脑子装的是浆糊吗  孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.72,0:08:56.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got spaghetti for brains, kid?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.55,0:08:59.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们就是年轻版的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.55,0:08:59.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We are the younger ones
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.70,0:09:00.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,至于老年版的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:00.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The older ones
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.37,0:09:03.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,愿他们安息
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.37,0:09:03.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bless their souls
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.24,0:09:08.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在这家餐厅里永垂不朽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.24,0:09:08.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have been immortalized in this very restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.06,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(948,452)}逝者安息\N企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.06,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1242,452)}逝者安息\N美人鱼战士
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.87,0:09:11.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,节哀顺变  深切缅怀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.87,0:09:11.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry for your loss of
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.15,0:09:12.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:12.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yourself
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.90,0:09:15.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然很不想打扰你们开追悼会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:15.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hate to break up the memorial service
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.33,0:09:17.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但这里的塔塔酱已经用光了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.33,0:09:17.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but we're out of tartar sauce out here
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.50,0:09:19.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,塔塔酱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:19.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tartar sauce?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.62,0:09:22.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们熟知的世界都被那配料毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:22.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The topping that destroyed life as we knew it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:31.55,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(208,864)}塔塔酱
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.10,0:09:27.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但凡那天我的塔塔酱攻击没失败
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.10,0:09:27.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If only my tartar sauce attack hadn't failed that day
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.10,0:09:30.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们就不会生活在这片废土里了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:30.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't be living in this wasteland
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.99,0:09:34.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这么快就用完了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:34.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're already out?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.62,0:09:35.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:35.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yup
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.42,0:09:39.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这几块有嚼劲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.42,0:09:39.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Chewy bits
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.97,0:09:46.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道我曾经在哪里见过你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.97,0:09:46.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew I recognized you from somewhere
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.40,0:09:50.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那天你在场  把塔塔酱都吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.40,0:09:50.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You were there, and you ate the tartar sauce on that day
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.15,0:09:53.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知不知道你干了什么好事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:53.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you realize what you've done?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.95,0:09:55.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起  美人鱼战士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:55.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mermaid Man
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.15,0:09:56.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们无意毁掉你们的一生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.15,0:09:56.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We didn't mean to destroy your lives
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.75,0:09:58.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毁掉你们珍重的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.75,0:09:58.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and everything you held dear
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.03,0:09:59.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说我们让一切重回正轨怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.03,0:09:59.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you say we try to make things right?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.28,0:10:01.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然需要你出手相助
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:01.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With your help, of course
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.64,0:10:06.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不会跟你们组队搞什么有的没的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.64,0:10:06.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not teaming up with you to do Jack-diddly-squat
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.53,0:10:12.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,更何况  射线恶魔还卡着我脖子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.53,0:10:12.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Besides, Man Ray has me by the neck
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.04,0:10:15.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,邪恶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.04,0:10:15.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Evil
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.86,0:10:18.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,意思是说那场失败带来了莫大的创伤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:18.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Does that mean that the defeat was so traumatic
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.63,0:10:21.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从此你的心理被射线恶魔卡了脖子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.63,0:10:21.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that it has given Man Ray a stranglehold on your psyche?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.35,0:10:22.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:22.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Barnacles, no
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.75,0:10:25.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,意思是他给我脖子装了个电子项圈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:25.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It means he put this electro-collar on me
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.60,0:10:28.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,害得我永远出不了这家餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.60,0:10:28.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that won't allow me to leave the restaurant
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.75,0:10:31.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就来把那个破玩意取下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.75,0:10:31.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, let's get that nasty thing off of you, hmm?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.40,0:10:36.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个白痴搞的破坏还不够多吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:36.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Haven't you two idiots done enough damage?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.51,0:10:38.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这玩意抓不紧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.51,0:10:38.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't get a good grip on it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.90,0:10:40.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得找好点的角度
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:40.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Must need a better angle
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.86,0:10:41.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等着
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.86,0:10:41.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.60,0:10:42.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.60,0:10:42.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.97,0:10:43.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:43.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.20,0:10:47.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  可以搭把手吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:47.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Patrick, can you give me a hand here?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.32,0:10:49.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,离我远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:49.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep away from me
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.55,0:11:06.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哒哒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.55,0:11:06.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ta-da
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.50,0:11:07.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你自由了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:07.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're free
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.53,0:11:09.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们可不可以哄你和企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.53,0:11:09.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can we coax you and Barnacle Boy
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.29,0:11:10.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不再退休
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:10.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,out of retirement
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.09,0:11:11.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拯救我们已知的宇宙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:11.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to save the known universe?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.07,0:11:14.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来你证明了你的勇气  孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.07,0:11:14.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I suppose you've proven your mettle, kid
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.87,0:11:16.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我会盯着你们两个的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:16.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I'll have my eye on you two
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.18,0:11:19.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来扎破那个肮脏泡泡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.18,0:11:19.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, let's pop that dirty bubble
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.86,0:11:21.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实我们要打的是射线恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:21.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Actually, we're fighting Man Ray
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.62,0:11:24.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:24.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.17,0:11:27.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就让正义的灯塔照耀在魔恶线射上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.17,0:11:27.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,let the lighthouse of justice shine on ray man
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.31,0:11:29.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  那样也差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:29.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, I suppose that's close enough
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.97,0:11:31.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家一起回到过去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.97,0:11:31.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Back to the past, gents
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.82,0:11:34.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阻止你再次吃掉塔塔酱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.82,0:11:34.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to stop you from eating the tartar sauce again
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.01,0:11:35.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.01,0:11:35.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for the first time
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.97,0:11:53.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我准备好统治世界  掠取财富了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.97,0:11:53.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to rule the world and its riches
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.78,0:11:56.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还早着呢  射线恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:56.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Man Ray
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.23,0:11:58.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们给你送了点小惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:58.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We've got a little surprise for you
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.13,0:12:06.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不准吃我的塔塔酱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.13,0:12:06.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep your tongue out of my tartar sauce
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.81,0:12:09.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冒牌货
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.81,0:12:09.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Imposters
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.33,0:12:11.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你叫谁冒牌货呢  冒牌货
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:11.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who you callin' imposter, imposter?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.62,0:12:15.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我必须阻止我们的塔塔酱进了那个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.62,0:12:13.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I must prevent our tartar sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.92,0:12:15.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from being eaten by that--
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.24,0:12:17.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那白痴嘴里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.24,0:12:17.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that fool
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.62,0:12:19.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要想靠近我的塔塔酱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.62,0:12:19.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I want to get near my tartar sauce
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.80,0:12:21.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就得先过我这关
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:21.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got to go through me first
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.88,0:12:23.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得让我收回那些话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:23.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make me eat those words
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.17,0:12:25.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放马过来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.17,0:12:25.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bring it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.43,0:12:27.51,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(732,788)}没打中
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.51,0:12:28.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:28.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:32.39,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(708,748)}下垂
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.39,0:12:34.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不会让你赢的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.39,0:12:34.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll never let you win
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.60,0:12:35.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:35.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, I will
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.85,0:12:38.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要怎么理解这个  企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.85,0:12:38.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you make of this, Barnacle Boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.32,0:12:40.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是混乱的时间线  美人鱼战士
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:40.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tangled timeline, Mermaid Man
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.17,0:12:40.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.17,0:12:40.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm--
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.86,0:12:45.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们这群老东西正好帮我转移了注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:45.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You old coots provided me the perfect distraction
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.47,0:12:48.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好人间蒸发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:48.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now prepare to be disappeared
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.49,0:12:52.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,理论上听起来不错  你这位大恶人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.49,0:12:52.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sounds good on paper, you purveyor of pure evil
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.49,0:12:52.12,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(284,920)}纸
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.45,0:12:54.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但幸好  我们都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.45,0:12:54.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But fortunately, we all know
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.46,0:12:57.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,纸在水底下会怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:57.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what happens to paper underwater
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.33,0:13:00.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,企鹅男孩  上塔塔酱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.33,0:13:00.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Barnacle Boy, the tartar sauce
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.87,0:13:07.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从来没吃过那么多的塔塔酱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.87,0:13:07.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never eaten that much tartar sauce
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.90,0:13:09.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你明明吃过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.90,0:13:09.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, you have
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.70,0:13:11.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉有点不太对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:11.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it sure ain't sittin' right
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.37,0:13:15.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:15.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Foolish fools
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.17,0:13:18.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们的愚行又让我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.17,0:13:18.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Once again, your buffoonery has given me victory
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.62,0:13:24.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会尽情享受的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.62,0:13:24.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm going to savor this
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.38,0:13:25.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毕竟可不是每天
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:25.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not every day
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.40,0:13:28.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都可以打败美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:28.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I get to defeat Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.80,0:13:31.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,三次以上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:31.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,three times over
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.25,0:13:38.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  别吃塔塔酱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:38.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, don't eat the tartar sauce
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.75,0:13:39.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们来晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.75,0:13:39.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're too late
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.07,0:13:42.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们的胖朋友抢先了一步
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.07,0:13:42.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your fat friend beat you to it
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.19,0:13:45.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好吃我一激光枪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.19,0:13:45.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, prepare to taste laser
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.37,0:13:50.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:50.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So how--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.35,0:13:54.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我早说应该再往前穿越一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:54.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I told you we had to go back further
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.40,0:13:58.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,预备  起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:13:58.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Up, up, and away
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.10,0:14:02.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:02.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.36,0:14:09.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我搞不懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:09.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't get my head around this
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.95,0:14:12.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们都是打哪来的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:12.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are they all coming from?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.60,0:14:14.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又来一个时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:14.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Another machine?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.30,0:14:21.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我把你们这个破时光机处理掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:21.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I took care of your blasted time machine
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.87,0:14:30.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得坐下把整件事情想明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.87,0:14:30.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got to sit down and think this through
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.27,0:14:31.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.27,0:14:31.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotcha
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.10,0:14:34.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在监狱有得是时间慢慢想
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:32.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll have plenty of time for thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.93,0:14:34.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in the stony lonesome
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.02,0:14:35.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:35.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.94,0:14:37.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚刚有说话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.94,0:14:37.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还在理解刚刚那是怎么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm still trying to comprehend what just happened here
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.94,0:14:41.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说真的  挺简单的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.94,0:14:41.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's pretty simple, really
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.65,0:14:46.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你被一批打击犯罪的时空旅行者击败了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.65,0:14:43.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You were defeated by a cadre
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:46.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of continuum-cruising crime stoppers
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.79,0:14:48.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们  海绵宝宝和派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.79,0:14:48.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, SpongeBob and Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.74,0:14:50.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:50.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're welcome
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.55,0:14:56.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.55,0:14:56.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, there
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.97,0:14:57.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.97,0:14:57.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.98,0:14:58.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:14:58.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.93,0:14:59.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.93,0:14:59.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.89,0:15:01.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们只是想回来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.89,0:15:01.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We just wanted to come back
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.48,0:15:05.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再参观一下邪恶被永远击败的那一天
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.48,0:15:05.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and revisit the day that evil was defeated forever
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.67,0:15:08.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:08.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.78,0:15:14.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:14.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.50,0:15:17.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.50,0:15:17.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.48,0:15:19.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:19.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:32.53,起司 特殊标题,,0,0,0,,坏蛋集团
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:34.49,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(237.33,454)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:34.49,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(475.661,716)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:38.16,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.57,0:15:36.37,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(407.575,448)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.57,0:15:36.37,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(527.742,702)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.45,0:15:38.16,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(420.547,537.334)}客串
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:40.08,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:40.08,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.01,0:15:45.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  猜我今天收到了啥邮件
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.01,0:15:45.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, guess what came in the mail today
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.03,0:15:46.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.03,0:15:46.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.07,0:15:47.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.07,0:15:47.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.71,0:15:53.39,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(734,350)}美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩\N失踪的剧集
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.71,0:15:53.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩  失踪的剧集
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.71,0:15:53.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy lost episode"?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.39,0:15:54.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,塞进去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:54.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stick it in
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.23,0:16:03.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比光速还快
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.23,0:16:03.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Faster than light
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:04.98,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(705.231,822.154)}啪
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.98,0:16:05.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阻止罪犯胡来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:05.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're there to stop crime
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.24,0:16:07.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是美人鱼战士
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.24,0:16:07.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's Mermaid Man
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.91,0:16:10.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:10.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And Barnacle Boy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.59,0:16:12.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果你遇上困境
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.59,0:16:12.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you're in a jam
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.01,0:16:18.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.01,0:16:18.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.00,0:16:24.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩的冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:24.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The adventures of Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.29,0:16:26.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今晚播出的剧集是  秘密集会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.29,0:16:26.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tonight's episode: "The secret meeting"
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.90,0:16:28.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在美人鱼洞深处
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:28.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Deep in the mer-cave
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.42,0:16:31.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有件怪事引起了美人鱼战士的注意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:31.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,something strange takes Mermaid Man's attention
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.38,0:16:33.01,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(390,238)}公交站
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.40,0:16:32.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肮脏泡泡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:32.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The dirty bubble?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.52,0:16:35.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他在公交站干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.52,0:16:35.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's he doing at the bus stop?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.05,0:16:37.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他似乎是买了张前往裤头村的单程票
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.05,0:16:37.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's got a one-way ticket to Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.81,0:16:42.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而肮脏泡泡在裤头村只会有一样企图
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.81,0:16:40.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and there's only one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.10,0:16:42.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the dirty bubble could be up to in Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.60,0:16:43.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:43.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Barnacle Boy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.70,0:16:45.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  美人鱼战士
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.70,0:16:45.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right, Mermaid Man
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.73,0:16:47.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,邪恶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.73,0:16:47.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Evil
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.25,0:16:58.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可怕的射线恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.25,0:16:58.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The terrible Man Ray
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.41,0:17:00.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你能赶上  我可真高兴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:17:00.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you could make it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.99,0:17:03.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我绝对不会错过这场盛事  脏泡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.99,0:17:03.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't miss this for the world, dirty
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.29,0:17:08.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最强大的甲壳类动物  巨霸虾来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:08.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The most powerful of all crustaceans, it's jumbo shrimp
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.71,0:17:10.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是原子比目鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.71,0:17:10.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the atomic flounder
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.94,0:17:14.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,核试验严重出错产生的可憎之物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.94,0:17:13.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the abomination of a nuclear experiment
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:14.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,gone horribly wrong
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.08,0:17:17.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以及下水道里的恐怖生物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.08,0:17:17.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And the terror of the sewers
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.97,0:17:20.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃人的邪恶臭蛞蝓
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.97,0:17:20.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the man-eating sinister slug
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.45,0:17:23.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们总算会师了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.45,0:17:23.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We join forces at last
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.86,0:17:26.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,情况比我预想中的还要严重
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:26.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's worse than I could have imagined--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.37,0:17:27.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是团伙作案
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:27.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a team-up
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.48,0:17:30.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到坏聚会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.48,0:17:30.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the BGATFBC
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.85,0:17:38.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,四月三日  中午十二点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.85,0:17:38.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,April 3rd, 12:00 noon?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.75,0:17:39.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是明天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:39.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.91,0:17:40.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.91,0:17:40.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Holy--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.55,0:17:45.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.55,0:17:45.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.25,0:17:46.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可以修
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:46.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can fix it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.30,0:17:58.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的老天啊  美人鱼战士
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:58.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Griping guppies, Mermaid Man
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.17,0:17:59.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们马上行动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.17,0:17:59.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We got to do something
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.34,0:18:01.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还不行  小不点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.34,0:18:01.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, little flipper
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.20,0:18:03.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们人手严重不足
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.20,0:18:03.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're far too outmanned
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.35,0:18:04.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是不用怕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:04.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But fear not
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.82,0:18:08.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我永远快邪恶一步
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.82,0:18:08.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm always one step ahead of evil
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.32,0:18:11.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们的海底英雄发出了紧急呼叫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:11.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Our hero of the brine puts out an urgent call
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.52,0:18:14.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,呼叫深海最伟大的英雄们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.52,0:18:14.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To the ocean's greatest heroes
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.75,0:18:17.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  我可以等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:17.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can hold
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:26.29,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(514,214)}邪恶汽车旅馆
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.93,0:18:23.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,同时  一群坏蛋们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.93,0:18:23.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile a sinister horde
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.90,0:18:26.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在邪恶旅馆前会合了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.90,0:18:26.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,congregates outside hotel evil
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.52,0:18:28.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这边请  先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:28.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right this way, gentlemen
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.10,0:18:31.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这边是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:31.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's goin' on in here?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.88,0:18:34.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是不好意思  先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:34.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm dreadfully sorry, gentlemen
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.77,0:18:36.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们一定是进错房间了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.77,0:18:36.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You must be in the wrong room
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.42,0:18:40.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这间是给坏聚会预留的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:40.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This room is reserved for the BGATFBC
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.89,0:18:41.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.89,0:18:41.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's funny
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.68,0:18:44.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我以为这间是给正联留的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:44.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought it was set aside for the IJLSA
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.51,0:18:46.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正联
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.51,0:18:46.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,IJLSA?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.42,0:18:48.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那到底是个什么玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:48.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What in coral caverns is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.42,0:18:51.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:51.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.06,0:18:52.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.06,0:18:52.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.37,0:18:56.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在你们不得不说再见之前
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.37,0:18:56.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, before you have to say good-bye
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.82,0:18:58.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先跟这几位朋友问个好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.82,0:18:58.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,say hello to some friends
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.15,0:19:04.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,弹性胖胖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.15,0:19:04.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The elastic waistband
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.57,0:19:07.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这位是全国最火热的打击犯罪者
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:07.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Greet the hottest crime fighter in the country
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.66,0:19:10.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怒火教授
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.66,0:19:10.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,professor magma
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.17,0:19:15.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,神出鬼没的无影小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.17,0:19:15.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The elusive miss appear
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.76,0:19:20.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以及黄铁沉思者
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.76,0:19:20.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And the pyrite ponderer
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.35,0:19:22.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,头戴学识之法网
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.35,0:19:22.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with his hairnet of knowledge
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.64,0:19:24.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们真的存在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:24.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do we really exist?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.50,0:19:26.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们就是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.50,0:19:26.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Together, we are
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.15,0:19:31.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,国际超级老相识正义联盟会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.15,0:19:28.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The international justice lodge
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.98,0:19:31.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of super acquaintances
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.52,0:19:33.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.52,0:19:33.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's get 'em, boys
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.12,0:19:44.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别想跟坏聚会打
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:44.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do not tussle with the BGATFBC
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.70,0:19:49.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,暴力解决不了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.70,0:19:49.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Violence resolves nothing
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.50,0:19:53.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安  气球小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:53.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good night, balloon boy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.04,0:19:57.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怒火教授  接着
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.04,0:19:57.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Professor magma, catch
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.57,0:20:04.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一边去  你这臭比目鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.57,0:20:04.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Step aside, you copious cod
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.80,0:20:06.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的死对头是肮脏泡泡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.80,0:20:06.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My beef is with the bubble
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.40,0:20:07.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心点  企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.40,0:20:07.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Careful, Barnacle Boy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.90,0:20:09.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他有核辐射之碰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.90,0:20:09.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's got nuclear touch
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.65,0:20:14.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,核辐射之碰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.65,0:20:14.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nuclear touch
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.32,0:20:17.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不敢看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.32,0:20:17.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't watch
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.78,0:20:25.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,家具散架了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.78,0:20:25.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fracturing furniture
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.15,0:20:26.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坚持住  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.15,0:20:26.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hang tight, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.23,0:20:41.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,撑住  我勇敢的副手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.23,0:20:41.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, my daring deputy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.71,0:20:48.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你勇敢的副手现在在睡觉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.71,0:20:48.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your daring deputy is napping right now
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.45,0:20:51.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过我很乐意把这个消息传达过去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.45,0:20:51.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I'd be happy to pass along the message
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.18,0:20:54.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,前提是他能醒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.18,0:20:54.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If he ever wakes up, that is
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.17,0:20:58.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,见鬼了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.17,0:20:58.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Swirling shrimp
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.75,0:21:01.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个恶魔控制了企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.75,0:21:01.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That fiend has taken control of Barnacle Boy
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.42,0:21:03.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该怎么办  美人鱼战士
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.42,0:21:03.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do we do, Mermaid Man?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.70,0:21:05.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,问得好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.70,0:21:05.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you asked
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.27,0:21:08.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在我看来  如果原子比目鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.27,0:21:08.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I believe if the atomic flounder
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.41,0:21:10.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能碰到那个赘生物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.41,0:21:10.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,were to touch that wretched growth
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.18,0:21:12.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就会引发链式反应
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.18,0:21:12.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it would cause a chain reaction
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.05,0:21:14.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,反转分子极性
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.05,0:21:14.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,reversing the polarity at the molecular level
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.95,0:21:18.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让企鹅男孩恢复原状
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.95,0:21:18.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,restoring Barnacle Boy to his natural state
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.70,0:21:22.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那说法八九不离十吗  怒火教授
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.70,0:21:22.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Does that sound about right, professor magma?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.98,0:21:25.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你做不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.98,0:21:25.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll never do it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.70,0:21:27.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你没那个胆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.70,0:21:27.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't have the moxie
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.98,0:21:30.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是你异想天开  无赖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:30.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's what you think, cur
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.47,0:21:33.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,盾牌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.47,0:21:33.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shield
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.11,0:21:43.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心  美人鱼战士
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.11,0:21:43.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look out, Mermaid Man
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.85,0:21:59.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,邪恶臭蛞蝓的黏液把你定住了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:59.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The sinister slug's slime has you stationary and stiff
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.83,0:22:03.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以说你命数将尽  朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.83,0:22:03.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,which means your time is up, friend
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.02,0:22:09.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,千万不要核辐射之碰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:09.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not nuclear toooooouch
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.17,0:22:12.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.17,0:22:12.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great gravy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.90,0:22:14.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.90,0:22:14.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.42,0:22:16.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等会儿再跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.42,0:22:16.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you about it later
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.28,0:22:18.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在来把垃圾丢出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.28,0:22:18.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now let's take out the trash
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.80,0:22:22.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请运用我的学识之法网
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.80,0:22:22.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, utilize my hairnet of knowledge
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.76,0:22:23.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尽出这份力
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.76,0:22:23.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for this endeavor
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.20,0:22:25.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢  沉思者
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.20,0:22:25.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, ponderer
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.52,0:22:26.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.52,0:22:26.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.55,0:22:28.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.55,0:22:28.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You guys don't understand
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.15,0:22:29.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,事情不是你们想的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.15,0:22:29.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not what you think
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.35,0:22:35.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们真以为
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.35,0:22:35.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You really thought
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.40,0:22:37.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自己能全身而退  是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.40,0:22:37.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you were going to get away with it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.42,0:22:38.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从实招来  坏蛋们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.42,0:22:38.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fess up, villains
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.85,0:22:41.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坏聚会是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.85,0:22:41.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's the BGATFBC?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.58,0:22:44.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全称是  坏蛋聚在一起读书会
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.58,0:22:44.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It stands for "the bad guys all together for book club"
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.27,0:22:46.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,读书会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.27,0:22:46.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Book club?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.69,0:22:48.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,意思是说你们并没有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.69,0:22:48.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean you weren't
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.07,0:22:50.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要摧毁图书馆什么的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.07,0:22:50.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,going to destroy a library or something?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.25,0:22:51.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛要那样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.25,0:22:51.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why would we do that?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.72,0:22:53.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们都快读到新章节了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.72,0:22:53.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're almost to the new chapter
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.50,0:22:56.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们干嘛  囚禁我们读书人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.50,0:22:56.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do, lock us up for reading?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.87,0:22:59.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  不能因为我们读书就囚禁我们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.87,0:22:59.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you can't imprison us for reading
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.89,0:23:01.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.89,0:23:01.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.85,0:23:03.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要记住  孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.85,0:23:03.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember, kids
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.39,0:23:06.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁都不可以囚禁读书人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.39,0:23:06.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,no one can imprison you for reading
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.53,0:23:08.19,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(740,854)}剧终
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.42,0:23:11.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.42,0:23:11.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.60,0:23:13.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,屏幕上那些歪歪扭扭的是什么玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.60,0:23:13.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why are those squiggles on the screen?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.87,0:23:16.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是演完后放的片尾演职员表  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.87,0:23:16.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those are called "end credits," Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.00,0:23:17.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,演完后放的表吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.00,0:23:17.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,End credits?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.47,0:23:19.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我不想要它演完啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.47,0:23:19.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I don't want it to end
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.87,0:23:23.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以海神王才赐给了我们倒带键
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.87,0:23:23.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's why Neptune gave us the rewind button
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.60,0:23:25.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢海神王
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.60,0:23:25.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Neptune
